    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hamani kongejiwa ikūjo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya mihayo yenīyī, ū ntemi Ahasuelo akang'ongeja ī likūjo ū Hamani ū mu būsugi bokwe, ūng'winha isumbī ly'ikūjo kūbaheeba a bana ng'oma biye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna pye a batūmami ba ntemi a ba ha mita būyūng'winamīla, kūlwa kūng'winha ikūjo, nguno ū ntemi akalagīla ītīlwe gīko. Alīyo ū Modekai walī atinamaga, nūūlū koolecha ikūjo ū kūlī we yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose a batūmami ba ntemi abo baalī a ha mita būmūūja ū Modekai, “Nibūlī ū bebe ūshidalahile ī shilagīlo sha ntemi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jikakwīla ī ng'hangala bakūng'wīlaga ū mhayo gwenūyo, alīyo ū wei walī walema ū kwīta ūmo bahayīlaga. Nose būng'wīla ū Hamani, babone ūlū gīkī ī mihayo ya ng'wa Modekai īkūngunanha īmīīle, nguno akasangwa wabawīlile gīkī ū wei Nyudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hamani aho wamona ū Modekai atinamaga ū kū būtongi bokwe, nūūlū atoolechaga ikūjo ū kūlī we, akapelana no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo aho wadeeba gīkī ū Modekai walī Nyudaya, ī liganiko lya kūgelela kūngoloolela nkono Modekai iyene akalīdalaha no. Ū Hamani ūkooba nzīla ya kūbamala pye a banhū b'ihanga lya ng'wa Modekai, pye a Bayudaya hose hose ū mu būsugi bo ng'wa Ahasuelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hamani kūbilumīla ng'haya Bayudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ng'weji gwa kwandya, ū ng'weji gwa Nisani, mu ng'waka gw'ikūmi n'ībīlī gwa būsugi bo ng'wa Ahasuelo, būtūlīja mbale, h'ī Puli; nū Hamani alīho alolile, bakoobaga lūshikū na ng'weji. Gūsolwa ng'weji gw'ikūmi n'ībīlī, hū ng'weji gwa Adali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Hamani ūng'wīla ū ntemi Ahasuelo, “Līlīho ihanga lya banhū līsambaalile hose hose ū mu būsugi wako, liguulanije ū mu banhū pye a bose būlī kwene ū mu sī ījo jilī ha sīlīlī ya būsugi wako. Ī nhūngwa ja banhū benabo jilekanile nī ja banhū a bangī pye a bose; nīyo nī shilagīlo sha ntemi batashidīlīlaga; nose ītīho solobo yose yose ū ntemi ū kwiyūmīlīja kwikala nabo a banhū benabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū gūlīnyeja ū ntemi ni afunyage shilagīlo bamalwe pye, ū nene nakūtūūla feza ū mu mfuko gwa ntemi, jikīlile a ha būdito wa kilo shihūmbī magana adatū na makūmi anè, balinhwe abīīti baago ū nīmo gwenūyū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi walī azwalile ū kū lwala lwa nkono gwakwe sīlī ya kūmeng'hela, wīyīnja ūng'winha ū Hamani ū muna Agagi, ūyo walī ng'wanishi wa Bayudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla ū Hamani, “Jilekage ī hela, alīyo a banhū benabo bīītīlage gīt'ūmo ūlībonela yigeleelilwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo sha kūbamala Bayudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'idatū lwa ng'weji gwa kwandya, a bandīki ba ntemi bitanwa. Pyī īyo akīlagīla ū Hamani bīyandīka mu nuguta ja banhū ba mu sī jose, na ndīmi ja banhū bose, ītwalwe ū kū baanangwa ba ntemi na a basugi ba sī jose, na a bana ng'oma ba kūfuma mapandī gose. Ī nyalūba jenījo jikandīkwa mu lina lya ntemi Ahasuelo ng'wenekīlī, hūna jūtūūlīlwa nū lūmeng'ho lwa sīīlī yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma būtūng'wa banhū būjisambaaja ī nyalūba jenījo, hose pyī ū mu sī ījo jalī ha sīlīlī ya būsugi bokwe ū ntemi. Jalī jilagīlile gīkī a Bayudaya bakenaagūlwe, babūlagwe, na kūmalwa pye a bose gete, bado na bataale; na a bakīma na a banīgīnī. Bamalwe mu lūshikū lūmò pye a bose, lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'idatū ng'weji gw'ikūmi n'ībīlī, ū ng'weji gwa Adali; nī shikolo shabo shisolwe pyī ī shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo yenīyo yandīkwa, yūtūūlwa ū mu sī pyī ī jose, gīkī shītwe kūbiza shilagīlo, hūna a banhū ba mahanga gose bamanīkījiwe, bandye kwibeeja beeja kūlwa lūshikū lwenūlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū abo bakatūng'wa būja wangū, nguno shalī shilagīlo sha ntemi; nū mu nzengo ntaale ū gwa Susa shūfunyiwa ī shilagīlo shenīsho. Hūna ū ntemi nū Hamani bigasha kūng'wa, alīyo a banhū a bangī ū mu nzengo būzwangana no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
